{"id":"2305757720","kind":"answer","title":"软件anki默认安排的遗忘曲线学习时间正确吗？时间会不会跳的太快了？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"间隔重复的历史","date":"2022-01-11","updated":"2022-01-11","votes":25,"comment_count":1,"minutes":1,"chars":491,"keywords":["间隔重复","SuperMemo","检索练习","记忆卡片","知识表征"],"summary":"Anki 的算法是基于 SM-2 修改的，其详细介绍可以参考： 叶峻峣：04 SuperMemo 1.0: 日志 (1987) 其中，SM-2 的第二个间隔是 6 天，是 Anki 3 天的两倍。而且 SM-2 算法不是基于遗忘曲线设计的，真正开始使用遗忘曲线的，是 SM-6 算法： 叶峻峣：08 1991：启用遗忘曲线 至于…","question_detail_html":"<p>刚开始学很快就跳到三四天再学习一次</p>","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/510875397/answer/2305757720","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"9EuAVm9g\">Anki 的算法是基于 SM-2 修改的，其详细介绍可以参考：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-9e2ee5b10cd764c7dd1be40b81aa6c6d_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"451\" data-image-width=\"1258\" data-tm-id=\"97887756\" href=\"#/post/97887756\">叶峻峣：04 SuperMemo 1.0: 日志 (1987)</a><p data-pid=\"wzLnJhtf\">其中，SM-2 的第二个间隔是 6 天，是 Anki 3 天的两倍。而且 SM-2 算法不是基于遗忘曲线设计的，真正开始使用遗忘曲线的，是 SM-6 算法：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-d6645a57ba597708046f91c9ba0b7757_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"654\" data-image-width=\"1200\" data-tm-id=\"441532847\" href=\"#/post/441532847\">叶峻峣：08 1991：启用遗忘曲线</a><p data-pid=\"jMp5bpzY\">至于这个时间是否正确？很难说，这取决于你的卡片难度。不同难度的卡片，有不同的遗忘速度，这里有墨墨背单词的数据为证：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-d9199f86641bb7438e6dacfeec65a083_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"920\" data-image-width=\"1440\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/19798259/answer/2125871191\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">用艾宾浩斯曲线记忆周期来背单词是否有理论依据？</a><p data-pid=\"igdJLoxN\">如果你制作的卡片过于冗长、模糊不清、缺乏理解，间隔再短也难以记住，而且会严重影响你的复习效率：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-57bbe8c427bb90bbe81876c1451dc090_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"706\" data-image-width=\"1000\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/346463057\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">叶峻峣：Anki 制卡对复习记忆效率的影响分析</a><p data-pid=\"XzA5sqDP\">另外，Anki 算法对记忆的自适应能力，是以卡片为单位的，无法利用整体的记忆数据。为了解决这一问题，我编写的以下算法：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-f9540a80c326b9131ca33befc9c8d679_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"904\" data-image-width=\"1280\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/454932406\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">叶峻峣：自由间隔重复调度算法——FSRS</a><p data-pid=\"thLvS2OU\">当然，以上这些内容，其实都不重要。对于使用 Anki 的人来说，编写出容易记忆的卡片，最为关键：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-3fc5e91c7a88c26207775c8301afbe1f_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"328\" data-image-width=\"1579\" data-tm-id=\"434074509\" href=\"#/post/434074509\">叶峻峣：如何写出好卡片：利用间隔重复创造理解</a><p data-pid=\"BZYevLc5\">以上就是我能想到的，可能对题主有用的内容了。</p>","rec_chain":[{"id":"434074509","title":"如何写出好卡片：利用间隔重复创造理解","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":1403,"minutes":55,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"97887756","title":"04 1987 SuperMemo 1.0: 日志","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":33,"minutes":14,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"441532847","title":"08 1991：启用遗忘曲线","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":16,"minutes":17,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"473666349","title":"15 间隔重复的指数式普及","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":18,"minutes":10,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"207094393","title":"06 1989: SuperMemo 适应用户记忆(中)","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":18,"minutes":13,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"205600711","title":"06 1989: SuperMemo 适应用户记忆(上)","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":17,"minutes":8,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"213170503","title":"06 1989: SuperMemo 适应用户记忆(下)","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":30,"minutes":5,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"95111167","title":"02 1985：SuperMemo 的诞生","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":66,"minutes":17,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"2666453985","title":"艾宾浩斯记忆规律真的有用吗 ?","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":787,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 787 赞同"},{"id":"2731574667","title":"艾宾浩斯记忆法是否科学？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":239,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 239 赞同"},{"id":"1373610154","title":"anki为什么没有在学生群体中大火起来？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":370,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 370 赞同"},{"id":"3130195046","title":"被北大录取女生分享经验时强调「没手机」，你上大学前有手机吗，是否会影响你的学习？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":278,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 278 赞同"},{"id":"2819053570","title":"高中生物应该背书还是刷题？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":186,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 186 赞同"}]}